presumes upon player strategy that may or may not be appropriate.

Moreover, I seem to recall Dylan rolling out some stats that suggest that 
much of the benefit of keeping character level low is illusory. For example, 
imagine that the vibrating square is on dlvl 51. Monsters are eligible for 
